{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"格"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"格"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p><strong>格</strong>同时是一种序结构以及一种代数结构. 这个巧合是由于其范畴层级较低.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>格是有二元"},{"Local":{"url":"积(范畴论)","text":"交"}},{"Plain":"和二元"},{"Local":{"url":"和(范畴论)","text":"并"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"偏序集","text":"偏序集"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"位象","text":"位象"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"Boole代数","text":"Boole 代数"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"分配格","text":"分配格"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"理想(偏序集)","text":"理想"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}